{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"综合评价","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/laozi/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-sage-of-the-dao","title":"道的圣哲","url":"/c/people/laozi/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/the-sage-of-the-dao","wordCount":1478,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/c/people/laozi/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment","wordCount":1600,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 综合评价\n\n本章在客观审视争议的基础上，对老子做出全面的综合评价。一方面，充分肯定他作为\"道的圣哲\"的卓越贡献与深邃智慧；另一方面，也客观地正视围绕其生平与思想的争议，并强调把握其思想的辩证本质。两篇文档，分别呈现道的圣哲，以及一个全面而辩证的评判。\n"}